The harness supports a clean native construction: conjugated affine matrices \(P\begin{bmatrix}B&d\\0&1\end{bmatrix}P^{-1}\). A target product is planted without solving; exact multiplication verifies any submitted generator word. The generic determinant-forced bounded search admits a measurable meet-in-the-middle reference algorithm, while the compact route is the paper-compatible change of representation: recover the common rank-one affine coordinate and read the target in base \(B\). I’m implementing that with simultaneous-conjugation and generator-relabeling invariance built into the canonical key.
apply patch
