+"""Verified problem generator for Potapov--Semukhin, arXiv:1604.02303.
+
+The paper asks whether a target 2x2 nonsingular integer matrix is a product
+of matrices from a finite generating set.  This module asks for an exact
+fixed-length product witness.  Instances are made by composing quotient
+identities P(a)^-1 P(b), so the witness is known before the target is formed.
+All arithmetic and all verification are exact and standard-library-only.
+"""
+
