The consistency pass is clean: the corrected renderer now shows an example with the exact required word length, and G5 attributes baseline cost to the successful Track B reference solver rather than to a weaker failing heuristic. The final local run has G1–G8 passing; stable cost is 969,520 product nodes / about 11.63 million scalar operations per instance, with wall time 3.25 seconds on this run. G9 remains the only failure because it has 0 scored oracle attempts.
